model ul09
  tally 1
  on 2026-10-18
  note "Box 3 (NL): the Belastingdienst's worked examples for 2022 (Wet rechtsherstel box 3) and 2025, the split of the joint base between fiscal partners, and the 2022 comparison with the old method."
  note "Each example is a key of ex; every def keyed by an example is evaluated at that example's peildatum, 1 January of its year."
  note "The Hoge Raad ruling of 24 December 2021 (ECLI:NL:HR:2021:1963) is the background of the 2022 method; it holds no figure."

source bd2022 "Belastingdienst, Hoe wordt mijn box 3-inkomen over 2022 berekend? (Datum 23-02-2023, DCTERMS.modified 2025-11-20)" at "https://www.belastingdienst.nl/wps/wcm/connect/nl/box-3/content/berekening-box-3-inkomen-2022"

source bd2025 "Belastingdienst, Hoe wordt het box 3-inkomen over 2025 berekend? (Datum 30-10-2024, DCTERMS.modified 2026-03-09)" at "https://www.belastingdienst.nl/wps/wcm/connect/nl/box-3/content/berekening-box-3-inkomen-2025"

source modeller "The model's own readings and assumptions, each stated with its reason"

source stb_2020_546 "Wet van 16 december 2020 (Wet aanpassing box 3), Stb. 2020, 546, uitgegeven 23-12-2020: art. I onderdeel A, art. 2.13 '30%' vervangen door '31%'" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stb-2020-546.html"

source stb_2022_533 "Wet van 21 december 2022 tot wijziging van het voordeel uit sparen en beleggen als bedoeld in artikel 5.2 van de Wet inkomstenbelasting 2001 (Wet rechtsherstel box 3), Stb. 2022, 533, uitgegeven 27-12-2022; read in its text on wetten.overheid.nl, BWBR0047699, versie vanaf 19-07-2025" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stb-2022-533.html"

source stb_2022_534 "Wet van 21 december 2022 (Overbruggingswet box 3), Stb. 2022, 534, uitgegeven 27-12-2022: art. I onderdeel C, new art. 5.2 lid 2 of the Wet IB 2001" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stb-2022-534.html"

source stb_2023_499 "Wet van 20 december 2023 (Belastingplan 2024), Stb. 2023, 499, uitgegeven 27-12-2023: art. I onderdeel C, art. 2.13 '32%' vervangen door '36%'" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stb-2023-499.html"

source stcrt_2020_64406 "Bijstellingsregeling directe belastingen 2021, 31 december 2020, Stcrt. 2020, 64406, gepubliceerd 31-12-2020" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stcrt-2020-64406.html"

source stcrt_2021_48308 "Bijstellingsregeling directe belastingen 2022, 28 december 2021, Stcrt. 2021, 48308, gepubliceerd 28-12-2021" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stcrt-2021-48308.html"

source stcrt_2023_7968 "Regeling van de Staatssecretaris van Financiën van 22 februari 2023 tot wijziging van de doelmatigheidsvrijstelling bankenbelasting en vaststelling van de forfaitaire rendementspercentages voor 2022 in de Wet rechtsherstel box 3, Stcrt. 2023, 7968, gepubliceerd 15-03-2023" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stcrt-2023-7968.html"

source stcrt_2024_12218 "Regeling van de Staatssecretaris van Financiën van 16 april 2024 tot vaststelling van forfaitaire rendementspercentages voor 2023 in box 3, Stcrt. 2024, 12218, gepubliceerd 29-04-2024" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stcrt-2024-12218.html"

source stcrt_2024_38492 "Bijstellingsregeling directe belastingen 2025, 20 december 2024, Stcrt. 2024, 38492, gepubliceerd 24-12-2024" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stcrt-2024-38492.html"

source stcrt_2025_8295 "Regeling van de Staatssecretaris van Financiën van 7 maart 2025 tot vaststelling van forfaitaire rendementspercentages voor 2024 in box 3, Stcrt. 2025, 8295, gepubliceerd 14-03-2025" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stcrt-2025-8295.html"

source stcrt_2026_3708 "Regeling van de Staatssecretaris van Financiën van 12 februari 2026 tot vaststelling van forfaitaire rendementspercentages voor 2025 in box 3, Stcrt. 2026, 3708, gepubliceerd 20-02-2026" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stcrt-2026-3708.html"

axis ul09_debt
  down "the return on the deductible debt cut down to whole euros, like the other amounts"
  half-up "the return on the deductible debt to the nearest whole euro (the page prints 2494,80 as 2.495 and 2597,40 as 2.597)"

axis ul09_euro
  down "returns on bezittingen, the voordeel and the tax cut down to whole euros (the page prints 68,50 as 68 and 20425,71 as 20.425)"
  half-up "returns on bezittingen, the voordeel and the tax to the nearest whole euro"

axis ul09_method
  page "the page's steps: each return to whole euros, the share as a percentage to 2 decimals, voordeel = rendement × share, the tax to whole euros"
  statute "the statute's formula, nothing rounded: voordeel = rendement ÷ rendementsgrondslag × grondslag (Wet IB 2001 art. 5.2 lid 1-2 (2025); Wet rechtsherstel box 3 art. 3 lid 1-2)"

axis ul09_share
  down "the share percentage cut to 2 decimals, as the printed figures show (82,4562 printed 82,45)"
  half-up "the share percentage to the nearest 0,01, ties up, as the text 'Rond af op 2 decimalen achter de komma' says"

index acat = [c_bank, c_other, c_green]

index ex = [ex22_1, ex22_2, ex22_3, ex25_1, ex25_2, ex25_3, ex25_4, ex25_5]

index heads = 1..2

index item = [savings, shares, investments, home_nl, home_abroad, green_inv]

index person = [taxpayer, fpartner]

input alloc[e in ex, p in person]: num question "Which part of the joint grondslag sparen en beleggen does this person declare (art. 2.17)?"

input cat[i in item]: key acat
  note "The class of each kind of bezitting: banktegoeden, overige bezittingen, or green investments."

input drempel[h in heads]: money EUR
  note "Schulden count only above this threshold (art. 5.3 lid 3 onderdeel f): key 1 for one person, key 2 for fiscal partners together."

input green_exempt[h in heads]: money EUR
  note "Exemption for green investments (art. 5.13 lid 1): key 1 for one person, key 2 for fiscal partners together."

input green_ok[e in ex]: bool question "Do the green investments qualify under art. 5.14?"

input has_partner[e in ex]: bool

input hvv: money EUR
  note "Heffingvrij vermogen per person (art. 5.5)."

input oret_k1: num
  note "Old method 2022: the deemed return of rendementsklasse I (art. 5.2 lid 1 (2022))."

input oret_k2: num
  note "Old method 2022: the deemed return of rendementsklasse II (art. 5.2 lid 1 (2022))."

input partner_all_year[e in ex]: bool question "Were the fiscal partners partners for the whole calendar year?"

input peil[e in ex]: date

input pga[e in ex, p in person]: money EUR question "How much persoonsgebonden aftrek is deducted in box 3 (art. 5.1)?"

input rate3: num
  note "Box 3 rate (art. 2.13)."

input resident_all_year[e in ex]: bool question "Was the taxpayer resident for the whole year?"

input ret_bank: num

input ret_debt: num

input ret_other: num

input schulden[e in ex]: money EUR

input wealth[e in ex, i in item]: money EUR

band old_rate(x: num EUR): num
  note "Old method 2022 (Wet IB 2001 (2022) art. 5.2 lid 1, the fictieve verdeling): the deemed return per euro of each band of the grondslag, its parts in rendementsklasse I and II at their returns; read with marginal."

def aandeel_pct[e in ex, p in person]: num at peil[e]
  note "Stap 4: the person's grondslag sparen en beleggen ÷ the (joint) rendementsgrondslag × 100, 'Rond af op 2 decimalen achter de komma'."
  rule base = round(grondslag_p[e, p] / rg[e] * 100, 0.01, ul09_share)
  rule nobase excepts base when grondslag_p[e, p] = 0 = 0

def bank_v[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e] = sum(i in item where cat[i] = c_bank: wealth[e, i])

def bezit[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 2: bezittingen, with the exempt part of green investments left out."
  rule base = bank_v[e] + other_v[e] + green_taxable[e]

def drempel_e[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e] = drempel[npers[e]]

def green_ex_e[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e] = green_exempt[npers[e]]

def green_taxable[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e]
  note "Green investments count only above the exemption (art. 5.13 lid 1)."
  rule base = green_v[e] - min(green_v[e], green_ex_e[e])
  rule nogreen excepts base when green_v[e] = 0 = 0
  rule notqual excepts base when green_v[e] > 0 and not green_ok[e] = green_v[e]

def green_v[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e] = sum(i in item where cat[i] = c_green: wealth[e, i])

def grondslag[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 3: grondslag sparen en beleggen = rendementsgrondslag minus the (joint) heffingvrij vermogen, at least nil."
  rule base = max(0, rg[e] - hvv_total[e])
  rule partyear excepts base when not resident_all_year[e] = ? "Resident for only part of the year: art. 5.2 lid 6 (2025) / lid 3 (2022) prorates; that is not modelled."

def grondslag_p[e in ex, p in person]: num EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 3: the part of the joint grondslag the person declares (art. 2.17; Wet rechtsherstel art. 3 lid 4; art. 5.2 lid 5 (2025))."
  rule base = grondslag[e] * alloc[e, p]

def hvv_total[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e] = hvv * npers[e]

def npers[e in ex]: int at peil[e]
  note "Fiscal partners for the whole year pool their wealth and double the heffingvrij vermogen (art. 5.2 lid 5 (2025), lid 2 (2022))."
  rule alone when not has_partner[e] = 1
  rule duo when has_partner[e] = 2
  rule partyear excepts duo when has_partner[e] and not partner_all_year[e] = ? "Fiscal partners for only part of the year: the joint amounts need the whole year; that is not modelled."

def other_v[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e] = sum(i in item where cat[i] = c_other: wealth[e, i])

def r_bank[e in ex]: num EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 1: banktegoeden × the deemed return on banktegoeden."
  rule rounded when ul09_method = page = round(bank_v[e] * ret_bank, 1, ul09_euro)
  rule unrounded when ul09_method = statute = bank_v[e] * ret_bank

def r_debt[e in ex]: num EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 1, Schulden: the deductible debt × the deemed return on schulden."
  rule rounded when ul09_method = page = round(schuld_aftr[e] * ret_debt, 1, ul09_debt)
  rule unrounded when ul09_method = statute = schuld_aftr[e] * ret_debt

def r_other[e in ex]: num EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 1: beleggingen en andere bezittingen (taxable green part included) × the deemed return on overige bezittingen."
  rule rounded when ul09_method = page = round((other_v[e] + green_taxable[e]) * ret_other, 1, ul09_euro)
  rule unrounded when ul09_method = statute = (other_v[e] + green_taxable[e]) * ret_other

def rendement[e in ex]: num EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 1: belastbaar rendement = the returns on bezittingen minus the return on the deductible debt."
  rule base = r_bank[e] + r_other[e] - r_debt[e]

def rg[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 2: rendementsgrondslag = bezittingen minus the deductible debt (joint for partners)."
  rule base = bezit[e] - schuld_aftr[e]

def schuld_aftr[e in ex]: money EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 1, Schulden: the debt above the (joint) drempel."
  rule base = max(0, schulden[e] - drempel_e[e])

def tax3[e in ex, p in person]: num EUR at peil[e]
  note "Box 3 tax on the voordeel after the 2022 comparison, less persoonsgebonden aftrek; before any relief for double taxation, which no source computes."
  rule rounded when ul09_method = page = round(rate3 * (voordeel[e, p] - pga[e, p]), 1, ul09_euro)
  rule unrounded when ul09_method = statute = rate3 * (voordeel[e, p] - pga[e, p])

def tax_new[e in ex, p in person]: num EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 5 / Stap 6: the tax the page prints, on the new-method voordeel less persoonsgebonden aftrek; before any relief for double taxation."
  rule rounded when ul09_method = page = round(rate3 * (voordeel_new[e, p] - pga[e, p]), 1, ul09_euro)
  rule unrounded when ul09_method = statute = rate3 * (voordeel_new[e, p] - pga[e, p])

def voordeel[e in ex, p in person]: num EUR at peil[e]
  note "The voordeel uit sparen en beleggen that is taxed. For 2021 and 2022 the Wet rechtsherstel box 3 applies the new method only where it gives a lower voordeel than the old one (art. 1 lid 4)."
  rule base = voordeel_new[e, p]
  rule herstel excepts base v law_wrh2022 = min(voordeel_new[e, p], voordeel_old_r[e, p])

def voordeel_new[e in ex, p in person]: num EUR at peil[e]
  note "Stap 5: voordeel uit sparen en beleggen (box 3-inkomen) by the method of the examples, at least nil (Wet rechtsherstel art. 2 lid 2; art. 5.2 lid 1 (2025))."
  rule nobase excepts rounded, unrounded when grondslag_p[e, p] = 0 = 0
  rule rounded when ul09_method = page = max(0, round(rendement[e] * aandeel_pct[e, p] / 100, 1, ul09_euro))
  rule unrounded when ul09_method = statute = max(0, rendement[e] / rg[e] * grondslag_p[e, p])

def voordeel_old[e in ex, p in person]: num EUR at peil[e]
  note "Old method 2022 (fictieve verdeling, Wet IB 2001 (2022) art. 5.2 lid 1-2) on the person's allocated grondslag; no page prints it, and no rounding is stated."
  rule base = marginal(old_rate, grondslag_p[e, p])

def voordeel_old_r[e in ex, p in person]: num EUR at peil[e]
  rule rounded when ul09_method = page = round(voordeel_old[e, p], 1, ul09_euro)
  rule unrounded when ul09_method = statute = voordeel_old[e, p]

ask q01_r_bank: r_bank[e] for e in ex

ask q02_r_other: r_other[e] for e in ex

ask q03_drempel: drempel_e[e] for e in ex

ask q04_schuld_aftr: schuld_aftr[e] for e in ex

ask q05_r_debt: r_debt[e] for e in ex

ask q06_green_ex: green_ex_e[e] for e in [ex25_5]

ask q07_green_taxable: green_taxable[e] for e in [ex25_5]

ask q08_rendement: rendement[e] for e in ex

ask q09_bezit: bezit[e] for e in ex

ask q10_rg: rg[e] for e in ex

ask q11_hvv_total: hvv_total[e] for e in ex

ask q12_grondslag: grondslag[e] for e in ex

ask q13_grondslag_p: grondslag_p[e, p] for e in ex, p in person where has_partner[e] or p = taxpayer

ask q14_aandeel: aandeel_pct[e, p] for e in ex, p in person where has_partner[e] or p = taxpayer

ask q15_voordeel_new: voordeel_new[e, p] for e in ex, p in person where has_partner[e] or p = taxpayer

ask q16_tax_new: tax_new[e, p] for e in ex, p in person where has_partner[e] or p = taxpayer

ask q17_voordeel_old: voordeel_old[e, p] for e in [ex22_1, ex22_2, ex22_3], p in person where has_partner[e] or p = taxpayer

ask q18_voordeel: voordeel[e, p] for e in ex, p in person where has_partner[e] or p = taxpayer

ask q19_tax3: tax3[e, p] for e in ex, p in person where has_partner[e] or p = taxpayer

version law_aanp_box3
  cite stb_2020_546
  governs 2021..2022
  known 2020-12-23
  note "Known from the Staatsblad, uitgegeven 23-12-2020 (https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stb-2020-546.html). A later act set 32% from 2023; it isn't modelled, so the span ends with 2022."
  rate3 = 0.31 "art. I onderdeel A: art. 2.13 'bedraagt 31%' (Wet IB 2001, geldig op 01-01-2022)"

version law_bijst2021
  cite stcrt_2020_64406
  governs 2021..2022
  known 2020-12-31
  note "Known from the Staatscourant, 31-12-2020 (https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stcrt-2020-64406.html). The Bijstellingsregeling 2022 left the drempel unchanged; the Bijstellingsregeling 2023 (Stcrt. 2022, 32674) raised it from 2023, which isn't modelled, so the span ends with 2022."
  drempel[1] = 3200 "art. I onderdeel T: art. 5.3 lid 3 onderdeel f '€ 3.100' vervangen door '€ 3.200'"
  drempel[2] = 6400 "art. I onderdeel T: art. 5.3 lid 3 onderdeel f, partners gezamenlijk, '€ 6.200' vervangen door '€ 6.400'"

version law_bijst2022
  cite stcrt_2021_48308
  governs 2022
  known 2021-12-28
  note "Known from the Staatscourant, 28-12-2021 (https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stcrt-2021-48308.html). Art. I onderdeel T restates the whole table of art. 5.2 lid 1; the class splits are those of the Wet aanpassing box 3. The old method ends with 2022: the Overbruggingswet box 3 replaced art. 5.2 from 2023."
  note "The old-method bands are also printed on the Belastingdienst page 'Oude methode box 3-inkomen' (table 'Schijven en percentages oude methode box 3-inkomen 2022'), as 'tot € 50.651', 'vanaf € 50.651 tot € 962.351', 'vanaf € 962.351'; the edges are the same."
  hvv = 50650 "art. I onderdeel U: art. 5.5 '€ 50.000' vervangen door '€ 50.650'"
  old_rate: [0, 50650] = 0.67 * oret_k1 + 0.33 * oret_k2 "art. I onderdeel T: art. 5.2 lid 1, tabel, rij 1 'meer dan € 0, niet meer dan € 50.650': rendementsklasse I '67%', II '33%' (closed at 0, so a nil grondslag reads 0)"
  old_rate: (50650, 962350] = 0.21 * oret_k1 + 0.79 * oret_k2 "art. 5.2 lid 1, tabel, rij 2 'meer dan € 50.650, niet meer dan € 962.350': I '21%', II '79%'"
  old_rate: (962350, inf) = 0 * oret_k1 + 1 * oret_k2 "art. 5.2 lid 1, tabel, rij 3 'meer dan € 962.350': I '0%', II '100%'"
  oret_k1 = -0.0001 "art. I onderdeel T: art. 5.2 lid 1, rendementsklasse I '0,03%' vervangen door '-0,01%'"
  oret_k2 = 0.0553 "art. I onderdeel T: art. 5.2 lid 1, rendementsklasse II '5,69%' vervangen door '5,53%'"

version law_overbrug
  cite stb_2022_534
  governs 2023..
  known 2022-12-27
  note "Known from the Staatsblad, uitgegeven 27-12-2022 (https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stb-2022-534.html). Only the debt percentage is a row: it is what art. 5.2 lid 2 printed for schulden on 1 January 2025, until Stcrt. 2025, 8295 replaced it from 2024."
  ret_debt = 0.0246 "art. I onderdeel C: art. 5.2 lid 2, schulden '2,46%'"

version law_wrh2022
  cite stb_2022_533
  governs 2022
  known 2022-12-27
  note "Known from the Staatsblad, uitgegeven 27-12-2022 (https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stb-2022-533.html). Kolom I and III of the 2022 row were set again under art. 4 by Stcrt. 2023, 7968 (law_wrh_reg2023); kolom II stands as published."
  note "Art. 1 lid 2 onderdeel b and lid 4: for 2021 and 2022 the voordeel is set by this law only where that gives a lower voordeel; art. 2 lid 2: at least nil; art. 3 lid 1-2: voordeel = rendement ÷ rendementsgrondslag × grondslag; art. 3 lid 4: partners use their allocated part and the joint values."
  note "The Belastingdienst 2022 page prints the 2022 row as Stcrt. 2023, 7968 set it (0,00%, 5,53%, 2,28%) in its intro list."
  ret_bank = 0.0001 "art. 3 lid 3, tabel, rij 2022, kolom I, as published '0,01%'"
  ret_debt = 0.0246 "art. 3 lid 3, tabel, rij 2022, kolom III, as published '2,46%'"
  ret_other = 0.0553 "art. 3 lid 3, tabel, rij 2022, kolom II '5,53%'"

version law_wrh_reg2023
  cite stcrt_2023_7968
  governs 2022
  known 2023-03-15
  note "Known from the Staatscourant, 15-03-2023 (https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stcrt-2023-7968.html): art. II replaces kolom I and III of the 2022 row of art. 3 lid 3 Wet rechtsherstel box 3, terugwerkend tot en met 1 januari 2022. The text on wetten.overheid.nl (versie vanaf 19-07-2025) prints the same row."
  ret_bank = 0 "art. II: art. 3 lid 3, tabel, rij 2022, kolom I '0,01%' vervangen door '0,00%'"
  ret_debt = 0.0228 "art. II: art. 3 lid 3, tabel, rij 2022, kolom III '2,46%' vervangen door '2,28%'"

